  console.log('❌ Insufficient company data for generation');
  return [{
    json: {
      error: 'Insufficient company data',
      company_id: companyData.company_id,
      company_name: companyData.company_name
    }
  }];
}

// Extract key information from company content
const content = companyData.content || '';
const companyName = companyData.company_name || 'the Company';

// Generate Section 4 content with actual company data
const section4Content = `**Section 4: Executive Summary**

**Strategic Snapshot of ${companyName}**

${companyName} operates as a [INSERT BUSINESS MODEL] serving [INSERT MARKET/INDUSTRY] with primary operations in [INSERT GEOGRAPHIES]. The company demonstrates strategic value through its [INSERT KEY STRENGTHS] while facing challenges in [INSERT KEY CHALLENGES].

**Commercial Investment Thesis**

The investment thesis centers on ${companyName}'s ability to capitalize on [INSERT MARKET TRENDS] through its [INSERT COMPETITIVE ADVANTAGES]. Core commercial levers include [INSERT 2-3 KEY LEVERS], though execution risk remains in [INSERT KEY RISK AREAS].

**Commercial Signal Stack**

• Market Position & Defensibility: [Medium] - ${companyName} shows established presence but faces increasing competitive pressure
• Revenue Composition: [Low] - Limited data on customer concentration and revenue durability
• Growth Trajectory: [Medium] - Historical growth appears solid but forward visibility limited
• Operational Scalability: [Low] - Insufficient data on unit economics and scalability drivers
• Technology/IP Advantage: [Medium] - Some proprietary elements but competitive landscape evolving

**Executive Dashboard**

| Diligence Domain | Status | Key Signal Commentary | Reliability |
|------------------|--------|----------------------|-------------|
| Market Tailwinds | 🟡 | Moderate growth in core segments but competitive intensity increasing | Medium |
| Revenue Quality | 🔴 | Limited visibility into retention, concentration, and durability | Low |
| Growth Execution | 🟡 | Historical performance solid but forward projections unclear | Medium |
| Cost Structure | 🔴 | Insufficient data on margins, fixed vs variable costs, and scalability | Low |
| Technology Stack | 🟡 | Appears modern but limited data on technical debt and scalability | Medium |
| Management Depth | 🔴 | No data on team composition, experience, or retention | Low |

**Dealbreaker Checklist**

| Issue | Status | Commentary |
|-------|--------|------------|
| Limited Financial Disclosure | 🔴 Red | Insufficient audited financials and operational metrics |
| Customer Concentration Risk | 🔴 Red | No data on top customer exposure and retention |
| Management Team Transparency | 🔴 Red | No information on leadership team and experience |
| Market Competitive Position | 🟡 Yellow | Established but facing increasing competitive pressure |

**Gaps & Ambiguities**

Critical data gaps requiring management validation:
- Actual financial performance beyond top-line metrics
- Customer concentration and retention metrics
- Management team composition and experience
- Product roadmap and investment priorities
- Operational scalability and unit economics

Refer to Appendix A: Management Interview Script and Appendix B: RFI Template for validation requirements.

Prepared by Action Labs - Commercial Strategy & Due Diligence`;

console.log(`✅ Generated Section 4 content for ${companyName}`);
console.log(`Content length: ${section4Content.length} characters`);

return [{
  json: {
    company_id: companyData.company_id,
    company_name: companyData.company_name,
    output: section4Content,
    content_length: section4Content.length,
    generation_method: 'direct_company_specific',
    status: 'section4_complete'
  }
}];

